@format 1
@id tabs.select
@title Select tab
@area Tabs
@entry input
@summary Change the current tab and synchronize visible workspace ownership.
@flow TB
@related tabs.add, tabs.close

@alias toolbar = Cadroue.UIShell.PControlBar.PToolbar
@alias tabset = Cadroue.UIShell.PControlBar.LTabset

[input] Tab pressed <input>
- Identify the pressed tab record @ toolbar.PTabPressHandle(...)
> select

[select] Change current record <process>
- Set the requested record as current and update tab selection state @ tabset.LTabsetSelect(...)
> result

[result] Tab selected <output>
= The requested workspace becomes the active tab surface.
